      "source": "call Scripts\ncall World\nget Instance\n\nlocal block = Instance.create(\"prism6\", World)\nblock.Name = \"FixtureBlock\"\nblock.Position = vanilla3D.Position(0, 2, 0)\nblock.Color = \"#f2b134\"\nprint(\"fixture script running\")\n\nfor step in 1, 3 do\n    block.Position.Y = block.Position.Y + 0.5\n    wait(0.1)\nend\n"
